001936                    ; SDB_FAT_NEXT
001937                    ; Reads the FAT32 chain successor of a cluster. Uses a one entry cache for
001938                    ; the FAT sector, so a run of consecutive clusters costs one SD card block
001939                    ; read per 128 clusters. Expects SDB_GUARD_IN to have been called.
001940                    ;
